── MISMATCHED TYPES ──────────── E0311_mismatched_generic_types.lt:1:65  [E0311]

Expected `Map<…, List<str>>`, found `Map<…, List<i64>>`:

  1 │ fn totals(orders: Map<str, List<i64>>) -> Map<str, List<str>> { orders }
    │                                                                 ^^^^^^

Stilt never converts a value to another type on its own. Give a value of the
expected type, convert it with a method such as `to_f64()`, or change what
expects it.
